     height is not a constant - homeWorkspace.ts writes the real measured
     value into the property, so a hero that wraps at a different zoom or
     font moves the pin with it instead of leaving the cards tucked
     underneath. The floor still runs to the bottom edge of the viewport and
     not to the dock's top edge: the dock is fixed above these cards and
     only 94% opaque, so a card that stopped short would show its own end
